          "text": "GOSPEL ORGAN\n\nFull-throttle Hammond B3 with ALL\ndrawbars pushed for maximum power.\nFast Leslie + hall reverb = church!\n\nSignal:\nKeyboard -> Organ -> VCA -> Leslie -> Reverb -> Out\n\nALL drawbars cranked = massive sound.\nScanner C3 = widest chorus.\nPercussion 3rd harmonic for bite.\n\nTips:\n- Play big chords for full effect\n- Leslie on FAST is essential\n- This is LOUD - adjust VCA if needed\n- Toggle Leslie SLOW for quiet passages"
        }
      }
